  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)-FSD Catering, Fashion Design &amp; Beauty Care Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LSETF-FSD Vocational (Green Catering, Fashion Design, and Beauty Care) Skills Training Project 2 will address youth unemployment in Lagos by improving job skills and employment outcomes in the Hospitality and Fashion sectors. The Project will offer a twelve-week program for 400 youth aged 18-35 years old. Students will be organized into three batches. Trainees will gain skills in Green Creative Catering &amp; Hospitality, Green Fashion Design, and Natural Hair &amp; Beauty Care. Upon completion of the training program, certified trainees will be placed in a three-month internship with employers in various sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
